#==============================================================================
# IWO (~2 at.% W:In2O3) FET, channel t = 6.3 nm  --  IWO_PHYSICS_CONSTRAINED_MODEL_V1
# Generated by scripts/build_iwo_decks.py from config/iwo_material_model.yaml (ONE material model for all
# thicknesses). Reduced electrical deck: ideal TiN gate / Pd S/D boundaries (equipotential metals, DC).
# MESH WIDTH = 1 um -> currents are A/um. Total 290-um device current = 290 x logged current. Never divide by 290.
# Cox = 8.9554e-07 F/cm^2 (HfO2 15 nm eps 19.57 + Al2O3 2 nm eps 9.0). Vd = 0.7 V, T = 300.0 K.
# Category labels: A intrinsic, B confinement, D bulk defects, E interface, F transport, G contacts, H numerical.
#==============================================================================
# [A] Eg_bulk = 3.05 eV | LITERATURE_IWO | Fan2021_Nanomaterials Sec.3 (different sputtered IWO device)
# [B] dEg_QC(t) = 0.0724 eV | DFT_PURE_IN2O3_PROXY | a*t^-p, a=0.9205, p=1.3815 (Lin2022 slabs, Si2021)
# [A+B] EG300 = 3.1224 eV | CALCULATED | Eg_bulk + dEg_QC(t)
# [A] chi_bulk = 4.3 eV | LITERATURE_IWO | Fan2021_Nanomaterials Sec.3 (composition-mixing estimate)
# [A+B] AFFINITY = 4.2276 eV | CALCULATED | chi_bulk - dEc(t), dEc = dEg (Ev unchanged, Si2021)
# [A+B] m* = 0.2177 m0 | MEASURED_RELATED_MATERIAL + DFT_PURE_IN2O3_PROXY increment | Stokey2021 bulk 0.208 + Lin2022 PBE increment
# [A+B] NC300 = 2.5498e+18 cm^-3 | CALCULATED | 2(2 pi m* kT/h^2)^1.5; effective continuum DOS at 2 nm
# [A] NV300 = 1.000e+19 cm^-3 | ASSUMED | holes not solved
# [A] PERMITTIVITY = 9.3 - | MEASURED_TARGET_DEVICE | Januar2026 SI Fig.S1 (C-V, IWO 9.30+/-0.04; not bundled, recorded by Astra)
# [D] Nt(t) = 8.4586e+18 cm^-3 | FITTED (anchor from real-ATLAS 2 nm fit: NTA*WTA) consistent with LITERATURE_IWO trend (Januar: ~4x from 13.2 to 2 nm; 5.3e19 at 2 nm with theta_t convention) | Nt2*(2/t)^alpha, Nt2=2e+19, alpha=0.75
# [D] NTA = Nt/WTA = 2.1146e+20 cm^-3/eV | CALCULATED | gTA(E)=NTA exp((E-Ec)/WTA); integral = NTA*WTA*(1-exp(-Eg/WTA))
# [D] WTA (kTt) = 0.04 eV | FITTED, shared across thickness | Tt = 464 K; shared across thickness
# [D] deep acceptor Gaussian = 5e+16 at Ec-0.6 eV, W=0.15 cm^-3/eV | ASSUMED (insensitive; Fan2021 range 2.5-3.7e16 for a different device) | 
# [D] Nd_eff(t) = 2.5246e+17 cm^-3 | FITTED law (effective electrically active background donor density, NOT W concentration) | Nd0*(1+(t/tc)^k), Nd0=2.5e+17, tc=20.0 nm, k=4.0; NOT W concentration
# [E] interface acceptor sheet = 3e+11 at Ec-0.3 eV, W=0.12 eV cm^-2/eV | ASSUMED, shared across thickness; literature Dit(HfO2/In2O3) ~6e11 cm^-2/eV (LITERATURE_IN2O3_PROXY; here IWO/Al2O3) | regularized 0.25 nm IWO layer at the Al2O3 interface: volume amplitude = sheet peak / 0.25 nm (numerically verified: layer /2 changes Id by 0.009 dec)
# [E] Qf = 8.7000e+10 cm^-2 | FITTED single shared value (stage 3); classified as effective electrostatic correction | dVfb = -q Qf/Cox = -0.0156 V
# [F] mu_band(t) = 11.582 cm^2/Vs | FITTED per thickness | FITTED per thickness (no defensible law; sigmoidal trend attributed to percolation/crystallinity, hypothesis)
# [F] roughness factor = 0.9110 - | LITERATURE_IWO (Januar2026 Fig.5f, 2.87 A) | (1 - Dsr/t)^2, Dsr = 0.287 nm
# [F] MUN = mu_band*(1-Dsr/t)^2 = 10.5508 cm^2/Vs | CALCULATED | NOT inserted natively: ATLAS 5.28.1.R ignores MOBILITY updates between SOLVEs (Claude run_0008); the free/trapped partition of Eq.(5) is produced self-consistently by the DOS occupancy; the Ando roll-off theta_r*Vov is an approximation gap (see LIMITATIONS)
# [G] gate work function = 4.7 eV | ASSUMED (TiN 4.5-4.9 eV literature range); degenerate with Qf and chi -> held fixed | 
# [G] S/D = ideal Ohmic (no workfunction)  | ASSUMED; underconstrained (no TLM); CNL above Ec in In2O3 supports low-barrier contacts (Si2021/Lin2022) | 
# [H] capture cross sections = 1e-15 cm^2 | ASSUMED | not identifiable from DC transfer curves
#==============================================================================
go atlas


